# Client (browser) Google Maps key.
#
# Requirements:
#   1. Create a key in Google Cloud Console.
#   2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API + Places API.
#   3. Restrict the key to your app's HTTP referrers
#      (e.g. http://localhost:5173/* in development).
#   4. NEVER commit the real value — copy this file to `.env.local`.
#
# Backend validation uses a SEPARATE server key (GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY in
# server/.env) because browser keys cannot be safely reused server-side.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<your-clientside-google-maps-key>